%% Today. A partition is saved only when all of it is done.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Scanning
    Scanning --> Processing: changed files
    Processing --> Processing: chunk, embed, append to store
    Processing --> Saved: partition complete (keyword index and manifest written)
    Processing --> Cancelled: Ctrl+C
    Cancelled --> Scanning: next run starts the partition again
    Saved --> Watching: brok run with brok-agent
    Watching --> Processing: file changed
